      "updated": 1788278388630,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Independently deployable apps\n    - You and your team should strive to make it so that you can do your jobs\n      which is being responsive to the needs of the business side of your team.\n    - that means you should be able to deploy and/or rollback  code to the next environment\n      anytime you see fit WITHOUT COORDINATION BETWEEN OTHER TEAMS.\n\nThis also means you can't deploy things that will break other people.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Independently deployable apps\n    - You and your team should strive to make it so that you can do your jobs\n      which is being responsive to the needs of the business side of your team.\n    - that means you should be able to deploy and/or rollback  code to the next environment\n      anytime you see fit WITHOUT COORDINATION BETWEEN OTHER TEAMS.\n\nThis also means you can't deploy things that will break other people.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
